  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="Tag136" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 18.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black;"&gt;12. Changes made during the year ended December 31, 2025:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 18.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-indent: .5in;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 18.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black;"&gt;Appointments:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
