&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;We have federal and state NOL carryforwards for which deferred tax assets of approximately $681,000 and $257,000, respectively, have been recorded as of December 31, 2025. The federal carryforwards have no expiration date, and the state carryforwards will expire beginning in 2037. We believe that we will be able to generate sufficient taxable income in the future to utilize all of our NOL carryforwards. Therefore, no valuation allowance has been recorded for the deferred tax assets associated with these NOL carryforwards as of December 31, 2025.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
