      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p class="MsoNormal">
          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 18.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;">As of December 31, 2024, we estimate that the following deferred tax balance in Account 282 could be used in the development of jurisdictional recourse rates:</xhtml:span>
